ked near little kids. And if you're scratching your head, wondering how Biden could still mobilize any voters remember this. He'll do only carefully choreographed campaign events.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: Spread the faith, folks, thank you all. So very, very much. Thanks.\par \par \uc2 JILL BIDEN: And God bless America. God bless America. Thank you. You go down on this, you go down here.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: When do we play that game where we throw the big ball back to each other? Plus, most Americans don't follow politics like you do and they don't even listen to what Biden actually says. So from a distance, Biden can still pass as someone from the old Democrat Party, the one that didn't hate America, that didn't think being a devout Catholic is a hate crime. And that thought criminals actually should be prosecuted not coddled. Right now, it's like buying a box full of air. Nothing inside is worth anything. But it's all they got. And that's The Angle.\par \par \uc2 Joining me now is \uc2 Stephen Miller\uc2 , former senior adviser to President Trump and Founder of America First Legal and Doug Schoen, Democratic Pollster and former adviser to President Clinton. Stephen, you and I were laughing listening to those fights, but it is it is very sad. I think he actually -- She said, God bless America. And then she said, you say and he said, you say. I think he actually had forgotten God Bless America there in the span of about 20 seconds. Do you agree with me that it has to be Biden for them?\par \par \uc2 STEPHEN MILLER\uc2 , FMR SENIOR ADVISER TO PRES TRUMP: Yes. So me and you are in exactly the same camp on the floor. I know. We've heard a lot of commentary saying we're going to wake up one morning and they're going to announce that \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  you're gone \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2 , you're in and we're done. It's just not that easy. They are anchored to \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 . They are shackled to this co