hey walk through the restaurant with their masks on and then they sit down very confused. Where's the menu? Mom, OK, she pulls this up, the glasses go along. I lost it. And then now she's Facebook Living. She just took a picture of herself. It's 20 minutes at least.\par \par \uc2 KENNEDY: And they lost a lot of weight because of that, the Q.R. codes.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: The Q.R. code diet.\par \par \uc2 KENNEDY: Yes, exactly. Better than keto.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Yes. Geraldo, you're going miss this. I know that you are one of the old journalists.\par \par \uc2 RIVERA: I am. Don't emphasized old.\par \par \uc2 KENNEDY: Never.\par \par \uc2 RIVERA: You know, LaGuardia Airport went from worse to one of the best except for two things. Number one is the distance from the curb to the gate.\par \par \uc2 KENNEDY: It takes a year and a half.\par \par \uc2 RIVERA: It takes forever.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Oh, yes.\par \par \uc2 RIVERA: It's a mile. And the other are the Q.R. codes. I mean, it has great restaurants. And I literally, I literally almost missed a flight and did not get my order. By the time I finally figured the damn thing out, it had taken me so long. And people are coming to help me and show me. I said, is there's something wrong with my phone? I hate them. I hate them. I hate them. I like switches that switch.\par \par \uc2 KENNEDY: Like menus that you pick up. And you look up and you go --\par \par \uc2 RIVERA: Read it.\par \par \uc2 KENNEDY: Oh, you compare with other people.\par \par \uc2 RIVERA: With the specials. There's the special.\par \par \uc2 KENNEDY: You flip it over.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: What I did was -- I remember, I couldn't figure it out either. So, I took my phone and I'm taking a picture of the Q.R. code. And I'm like OK, why isn't it showing me what the menu is? And it was like, I took a picture of it and that's it. But no, I figured it out. Stop laughing at me.\par \par \uc2 But first of all, I'm sick of it. You know what? The pandemic