 two big antitrust lawsuits against \uc2 Google\uc2  in like two-and-a-half years.\par \par \uc2 BAIER: Yes, pretty interesting. David, thank you.\par \par \uc2 SPUNT: You bet.\par \par \uc2 BAIER: Congress is taking on \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2  over the uproar concerning tickets to Taylor Swift's next concert series. Critics say the company has an unfair monopoly that hurts consumers, evidenced today by the questions. Here is senior congressional correspondent Chad Pergram.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO TAPE)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: No to \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 CHAD PERGRAM, FOX NEWS CORRESPONDENT: A spectacular fiasco prevented millions of Taylor Swift fans from buying tickets for her upcoming tour. That means her fans and \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2  are never, ever, ever getting back together.\par \par \uc2 SEN. RICHARD BLUMENTHAL, (D-CT) SENATE JUDICIARY COMMITTEE: \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2  ought to look in the mirror and say I'm the problem. It's me.\par \par \uc2 JOE BERCHTOLD\uc2 , LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT PRESIDENT: We apologize to the fans. We apologize to Ms. Swift.\par \par \uc2 PERGRAM: \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2 's parent company \uc2 Live Nation\uc2  blamed the Swift ticket meltdown on bots or automated consumers.\par \par \uc2 BERCHTOLD: We were then hit with three times the amount of bot traffic that we'd ever experienced.\par \par \uc2 PERGRAM: But incredulous senators said other industries faced the same problems.\par \par \uc2 SEN. \uc2 MARSHA BLACKBURN\uc2 , (R-TN) SENATE JUDICIARY COMMITTEE: They got bot attacks every single day by the thousands. And they have figured it out.\par \par \uc2 PERGRAM: Live nation says it's invested over $1 billion to try to combat the nuisance. \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2  and \uc2 Live Nation\uc2  merged in 2010. That raised Senate antitrust concerns. But executives dismissed those charges.\par \par \uc2 BERCHTOLD: \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2  has lost, not gained market share since the merger.\par \par \uc2 PERGRAM: 