istributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document TCARL00020221224eicn00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Biden Policy Creates Border Catastrophe\b0\par\par\uc2 Pete Hegseth, Sara Carter, Kellyanne Conway, Jason Chaffetz, Joe  Concha, Deroy Murdock, Gregg Jarrett \par \uc2 8,289 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 December 2022\par \uc2 Fox News: Hannity\par \uc2 SHAN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2022 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 ASC Services II Media, LLC.  All materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast without the prior written permission of ASC Services II Media, LLC. You may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 PETE HEGSETH, FOX NEWS HOST: Welcome to this special edition of HANNITY. I'm Pete Hegseth, in for Sean.\par \par \uc2 And tonight, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  is apparently very busy writing poems. Did you know he was a poet? To Doctor First Lady Jill Biden.\par \par \uc2 So busy in fact that he's unable to visit the southern border which is in a state of utter chaos as you know.\par \par \uc2 Now, of course, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  happily delegated this crisis to his borders czar, the esteemed Kamala root causes Harris. Many months ago, he delegated that.\par \par \uc2 Now, sadly, Kamala has done literally nothing to secure the border or stop the flow of illegal immigrants. She did however, to be fair, visit El Paso for about 20 minutes, but that's it.\par \par \uc2 And now with this crisis spiraling out of control, guess what? She's gone back to an old classic, she's blaming Republicans.\par \par \uc2 During an interview tha