ave a very good chance of taking Georgia as well. People got this wildly wrong and I think it is very unfair for anyone to think that people who ended up defying historical expectations should then turn around and kind of bow down to a party that managed to bungle something like this.\par \par \uc2 And I understand Kevin McCarthy is going to be challenged for the leadership. I don't know if anyone else can get over the 50 percent there, but there is no way that \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2  and Kevin McCarthy managed this well. I mean, there are people talking about \uc2 Patty Murray\uc2  losing her seat. It's completely ridiculous.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Do I owe you money?\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: You do.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: How much do I owe you, Jessica?\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: You owe me a $100 and you owe Geraldo a $1,000.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: OK, here you. I'm not sure if I'm still going to pay Geraldo, but --\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: You have to.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: -- there's a hundred for you.\par \par \uc2 DANA PERINO, FOX NEWS CO-HOST: A $100 bill. That's like big.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: It's very fancy. It's real.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: All right. OK, Let's get over guys.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: It smells like victory.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Stop, stop, stop. All right. Enough. What do you think the Democrats are saying, this is so progressive. We're the most progressive.\par \par \uc2 JEANINE PIRRO, FOX NEWS CO-HOST: Yes.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: The country didn't vote for a more progressive Democrat Party.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Look, the Democrats are taking this as a mandate, and the way Jessica sees it and the way the Democrats see it is it is a mandate. There will -- this will be the most progressive next two years that we've ever seen, and that's great for 2024.\par \par \uc2 But what's crazy about all of this is you have one of the most unpopular presidents in history. You've got incredible problems with inflation, with the economy, with Afghanistan. Ever