ove a fight, but the fact is he needs to focus on the policies that improved the lives of all Americans. He led this country through a difficult time, set us up for record-setting success and record- setting time. That's where the focus needs to be. The people want policies that actually give their families a chance for a better future. \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  did that. Focus right there and he'll be just fine.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Charlie, Hogan, great to see both of you.\par \par \uc2 And new details on who the Biden administration has put in charge of vote counting. What? The Last Bite explains.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: If you had doubts about the vote counts going into today, Biden didn't exactly assuage those concerns.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JOE BIDEN\uc2 , (D) PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: Doug crisscrossed the country. I think he did. he spent more time making sure that the folks who asked count the votes in these states do it honestly. Thank you, pal.\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Wait, the second gentleman, Kamala's husband, is now in charge of vote count oversight? What? That's like having the Democratic gubernatorial candidate in Arizona also be the secretary of state. Oh wait, that's what we have.\par \par \uc2 That's it for us tonight. Greg Gutfeld and the gang take it all from here. Have a good night. We'll see you tomorrow from Los Angeles.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2022 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document I